==Description==
The '''Witch''' was an enemy that appeared exclusively in [[Trick or Threat Town]] as part of the [[Halloween 2020 Event]]. For its debut it had average health, slightly more than the [[Buried]], but was quick. Additionally, it was a [[Flying]] enemy so it could not have been detected by ground towers or collided with [[units]].

==Appearance==
The '''Witch''' wore a black robe and had back legs. It had green skin, a long nose and an emotionless face. It wore a sorcerer's hat and rode a broomstick that levitated above the ground. Purple smoke was left behind the broom as it flew. 

==Strategy==
*As the '''Witch''' is a flying enemy, [[units]] (from the [[Military Base]] and [[Crook Boss]], and [[Citizen 1|Citizens]]) cannot collide or detect it.
**Ground towers also cannot detect the '''Witch'''.
**Only cliff and air-based towers can detect the '''Witch'''. These towers are the [[Ranger]], [[Sniper]], [[Ace Pilot]], [[Mortar]] and [[Pursuit]].
*As the '''Witch''' is quite quick, the [[Ace Pilot]] or [[Pursuit]] is recommended against them, as slow firerate towers may struggle against it.

