==Trivia==
*Similar to the [[Balloon]], some ground towers, like the [[Electroshocker]], [[Pyromancer]], [[Gladiator]] and [[Shotgunner]], could hit the '''Witch''' while it was in the air, if they are on a high platform or leverage.
**However, this could only occur on other maps via commands, as [[Trick or Threat Town]] had no ground spots that are higher than the path.
*The hat used by the '''Witch''' was a re-textured version of the {{RLinkC|1165243|Witch Hat}} accessory from the Roblox catalog.
**The broom used by the '''Witch''' was the {{RLinkC|36913601|Broom}} gear from the Roblox catalog.

